Game logic
----------
The rules, rule variants and computer players are ported from qt-hearts
(https://github.com/adelmonte/qt-hearts), GPL-3.0. The window, drawing,
card deck and theme code comes from solitaire-rs
(https://github.com/adelmonte/solitaire-rs), GPL-3.0-or-later.

Background
----------
assets/cleangreen.svg is the Clean Green theme from KPatience
(https://apps.kde.org/kpat/), by Parker Coates.

Font
----
The UI font is Adobe Helvetica from the X11 bitmap fonts. Its copyright and
permission notice are in src/font.rs.
